From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the readouts the libraries replaced go

The shell reads the backlight, audio, applications and bookmarks through
libraries on its system calls, so `DomicileHost`'s `searchApps()` and
audio members leave the module: DomicileAppSearch, DomicileDesktopEntry,
DomicileBookmark, DomicileAudioCard, DomicileAudioChoice,
DomicileAudioDevice, DomicileAudioStream, DomicileAudioLevel,
DomicileAudioLevelsEvent and DomicileAudioLevelsEventInit. Their IDL and
generated bindings leave the lists here.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 .../blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni       | 20 ---------
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni     | 10 -----
 2 files changed, 30 deletions(-)

